Litik: You did it! That's the Mystic Ylang-Ylang we came looking for.
You: The Guardian wasn't going to let us take it easily.
Litik: But you faced it, and now we have the flower. Chief's training really paid off.
You: What should we do with it now?
Litik: We should keep it safe. Our journey doesn't end in this forest.
You: Where are we going next?
Litik: There's another town beyond these woods. We should follow the path there and see who can help us.
You: You're coming with me, right?
Litik: Of course! Come on. I'll show you the way.
[signal arg="start_follow_litik_to_second_town"]
[signal arg="set_flag_litik_after_ylang_briefing_done"]
[end_timeline]
